       <div data-layer="proof" class="event-record-context">
-        <p class="sources-line">This story rests on the September policy statement, implementation note, projections and press-conference transcript; the July statement and minutes; the Federal Reserve's policy framework and Jackson Hole speech; August CPI and second-quarter GDP releases; fixed rate-series files; and coverage checked against those records. The press-conference transcript is marked preliminary on every page. The Associated Press reconstruction was retained by the capture registry as extracted text and markdown, but its run did not retain a raw-body receipt. Its two attributed observations are used with that limitation recorded in the manifest and working note.</p>
+        <p class="sources-line">This story rests on the September policy statement, implementation note, projections and press-conference transcript; the July statement and minutes; the Federal Reserve's policy framework and Jackson Hole speech; August CPI, July PCE, second-quarter GDP and CBO releases; fixed rate-series files; and coverage checked against those records. The press-conference transcript is marked preliminary on every page. The CBO page was recovered from the September 16 Wayback capture after its direct fetch returned 403. The Wall Street Journal live card is preserved through its Dow Jones Newswires syndication. The Associated Press reconstruction was retained by the capture registry as extracted text and markdown, but its run did not retain a raw-body receipt. Its two attributed observations are used with that limitation recorded in the manifest and working note.</p>
